       'm: Gم|If you don\'t feel well, you ______ see a doctor. (advice)|should|may|could',
       'm: Gم|If you finish your work early, you ______ go home. (permission)|may|must|need to',
       'm: Vم|______ look after passengers\' safety on the plane.|Cabin crew|Chefs|Travel agents',
       'm: Rم|If you enjoy working with people and food, a chef\'s job might be perfect for you. A good chef must have a passion for food and cooking and needs to know how to select food, prepare meals and create menus. // What must a good chef have?|a passion for food and cooking|a driving licence|a university degree in IT',
       'w: Rن1|Hotel managers are responsible for everything from good service in the restaurant to safety in the swimming pool. // True or False? => True',
       'w: Gم1|Complete with ONE word: If we go to London, we ______ visit Buckingham Palace. (possibility) => might',
